<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Compaq 97 EPS view raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Compaq 97 EPS view raised.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>SoundView Financial Group said analyst Mark Specker raised his 1997 earnings per share estimate on Compaq Computer Corp to $6.54 from $6.16.</p>
<p>-- maintained his 1998 estimate at $7.43 and his ratings at short-term hold, long-term buy.</p>
<p>-- stock was up 2-7/16 to 126-5/16.</p>
</text>
